{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1201,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b95c43651b1d5c59e03988d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像能跑出好成绩哦。\r\n看着吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0c1c3dfeb463a609f8966cbaa991904436ba88d6cbf8579c26fced8fcadb445",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0214660aed61af2cb7c3995f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轮到我上场了。\r\n看着吧，我会努力的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb6399adfe1c0d70815dd48f1333457adbdcded4e00b58de399de1a4bf15514",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:803113752326b97978298b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有点紧张……\r\n要小心不要乱了步调才好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f753152a3dc4b2833f81cc55e27bc7116ce645bd33868f374cb5bc85a7bcf1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5be0e3fd860e9baa030de9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要拿出平时训练的实力，\r\n应该就能赢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c555399c44d69d109e10d350d933e65f1f9f29565c9f452c741ed69d541427d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2890e41404c0cd9dcebddf85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没有完全准备好……\r\n但我会用全力去跑的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c007b144f8e32e32eddf932777e1bd98653341d0bc9d8fe6cc919d01afcebd5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9148aa1cbdb503d0a1fc5a35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态不是非常好……\r\n训练员，要麻烦你比平时\r\n更用力地为我加油了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf3af269cb16102b48c181c4973946e15fd910743febe6c9878b702f7fe9165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cb5b0d081a8575d5004e6df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算实力不够，\r\n我也要全力去奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1798dd9fffa4cd192338914ecb72041a8461d8ef85cbc6e7ed560cb550c5f3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9f7b5b719f2092ba025d70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以我目前的实力……\r\n不，无论如何我都会挑战的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2badc535db8bd95ecc34cb96e365542e68c4658af337904276cf4ba0d0e32c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:107704fb62ab352473a65369",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道能不能达到\r\n大家对我的期许……\r\n不，我只需要尽全力去奔跑就对了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd362007b3e0b82ec91b2cc5a498d990fcd11a73376327816721b116749cf033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ad3ac8acf58d931c88f2ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手全都具有实力……\r\n速度也比我快。但不实际跑过，\r\n就无法决定胜负……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d239c7b399b238396f9526c2ecd5f2fe748a69d259155dc5dd5a2ef251aa29bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabc68a0291a90fcb4c09e35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，就这么做。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c95677059123870e2f7dbaa87a4e315164e52d50f9121aeece7854ac968178",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3e995b6e1123999bf51b316",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请你看着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e94e3ffc579f30f9ba853366c3507b301e34de15989d2a657fd7e3af3cf298",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:527cb7abd9d409765a532ba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f70558d850ecc83c59a7f556d74001d25e024c7fa3678ca8a6cbcf1ef56f92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae34d10efa337243cf02ecab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好用功呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e82fdb97bdcaad9316b35e202ac4e6681faebd98c4153208d3a84b9859319a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8557d647d744697e7284ca18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉状态不太好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae709c9a974a044b4cbdbb07741998275494a2381c28bf35e1201ea9c962d4e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:331e6ba96aaf9522615ad592",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很困难呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b05808185a1c8657aab8276ea4f4314085bd4c3f897d568bdd41d560673bdf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22d0c0c254fa149ad567574c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们要去哪？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af33477ebfbc413cdb42b69f605f517f078fab95a1ce4f7671c142e1c558ac99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb2f435ec66cad074d68b8d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海、海边啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "700f76df38565532601cf0dfca37c35d547b6e74f555aa19960f3036cb768e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c5b1063145ac1ccb26390c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢……我确实感觉自己有成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa75b41c2dd6795cb70faa385aafc9c7f3e5c6c6350acf7f41a9d13c19b0f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c5b02c42cd97543cbbf672",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你照顾了，谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1914576fb73288530f7e86e57515396577dab10bd611e087bc0acfa10c122880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dfab7434c66e20fa4367e11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们一起做吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54cadc2d6da08773d2d147fddc79e76044efade2b6ce16ea0edf0c204f86ef73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc77711b08440894d7cab39a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去赢得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2587a7491af8ffdd491e1e1a33b946037d5d6a788f69548f5c0a648acc4bf3ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58073b1bf2e58e4e30026ad9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，全力表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a7f5a6fa0b95d94fb27c488ee3ac19ed8a5ce1dbbca0f357b427ae2ce8f4a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74f4ff206edbebc85c63ba5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你照顾了，谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1914576fb73288530f7e86e57515396577dab10bd611e087bc0acfa10c122880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802217cb03976217d67d5343",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉会有好的表现呢。\r\n看着吧，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dffa5239af4f37fcb3d0a59f13f6abfd6eb74cd990eb0fc00295652fcabed7b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a18f4c9bfe5327df3f133d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吼、吼、吸、呼～！\r\n状态很好！尽管吩咐吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe15a9b4775b24936170642419878cfd5334bbf8b669beb5bf92365b90253d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c44ce175595c26715b4dbe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你照顾了，谢谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1914576fb73288530f7e86e57515396577dab10bd611e087bc0acfa10c122880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:183e392465567bdb3e39afeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし、やろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b250beb97f0ef6c0f3914db6cd14538c74914868e76cb7ffd332f2b7216a059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7011ea97aeb23744a8636fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第二名啊……这结果还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbd58ecc7810fafcf1d2a05c0d548bdb9777108e14a5f63af2cc8c5277a9677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2eccefcc3082ed564421bd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……算是还不错的成绩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e91fa17743f7c58c555f21f40795c84d0d0cbf04487ae974e94a391667d4199e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b100ce8f6747c6eea94d1c75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就只有一步之差……",
      "source_fingerprint": "401f63ee51cd8777c7e7e0b3f4639de74d9196249ab51463b8e5084697fd5ad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3b269296be1bbae3561af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深感实力不足啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2d1e2ef03be678013172e1fb7e1a51d2abcbf4e3c69693bf8d153e7cd47937a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f077114879dc407db875a8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！嗯……肚子饿了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d1d768753fffd31d547887f432918292d5238a140d39b260fda889d6268343",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:102ab769bf68f31ddc70f292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的……好棒……！嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0fd567f0a77b7598fa71a33f6efaa22fa0405dff64bf1e2549ca782771cc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbf2fdffb0c44519911f3b4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你久等了。这是我要送你的礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e72ebb3173e5ec9ffaa5aee41b0002eec340f78bbabb8e731b98d8c156b48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496e0a5c361a071d658c5d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的……好棒……！嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0fd567f0a77b7598fa71a33f6efaa22fa0405dff64bf1e2549ca782771cc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6d979c52a5750c8de930d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你……爱着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5530de9d3c89b40d09696226da538d4f727e03f512d3a2d46922d4d3212ae6ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d69dac1e7935a65bf88c17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最棒……了……！好嘞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85bcad4408421986c7b616b015d26723e9dd1fef15f778284ff279ac522a3f0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76cb541311e205de92f466c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上场了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "092de8b679dc1d62be9d0345f00b41ce5d39669391cc434ea8f1c32929be88df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d805d4d55526fb2f41ec6ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是……我的全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac02a663fab0ca588b5d5cba70836597b56cc75bd3c8ba438637ae83e0ae5d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422ea57e3aaeef9d159021da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得可以跟大家一起过节。\r\n要过个开心、幸福……还有……\r\n开心的圣诞节喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1714428f04e3cc070e3ce467d0488f0e3b232ee0e24774f7d1a2295cab92d61e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92db850e7f70482c092359bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集训地点……会盛产山珍\r\n还是海味，或是两者兼具？\r\n我已经开始期待了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "715e74a00e8950276e178cca7095f29df32e205791158cdaf3eeb33a1500434d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75caf76f704b80628651bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用正确方式面对，雪就不是敌人。\r\n大家的心意还有我的心意……\r\n我一定都会传达出去的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7348d27b930cb9593134322e7f87e4f540319781a60c714ad0694f4453c21d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7024e9bfb323a9bae0b694b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子饱饱，也养足精神了。\r\n为了相信我而帮我加油的人……\r\n往后我也要保持强悍！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5749151bf3da90be552560837c7d762a70c040495dc6cdb1cd68740aed07dfce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9418c0d85aeb55f26f029826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……看着吧……这就是！我的！全力啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1593fec16b6bf57ce25a533a119f9a68a074f4de141c4239be212208f05099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707a214f852f15551b5837d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真希望未来……\r\n赛马娘们也能永远\r\n快乐地奔跑下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd094f56101fb802e283e07b954e7b51da1926aea57b84c72440e8761239a697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0810f967d765cc2d0fdf4386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你跟我一起奔驰。\r\n那么，最后要以蛋糕\r\n还是拉面来收尾呢……两道一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d405ae125078329bfac65625b7aac3a8988a4b0413604f80ab0561a4172a2c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b61dd02822ca0dc05766b0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将闪亮的星星……献给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db0a859f207fd0f204da430f1a72ec7fe3499381d4119d9a43ad4982af97f88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc9d8ac09af1cffe017a1edd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……好！我会抓住……大家的……闪耀梦想！\r\n呵呵……啊呣……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7760d26d2fc920808cf5aeb79769d5535382fd0a1760c44f0070142934286e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f408ba6eca4d6778d538c4b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么，好怕的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb9f277a3f051e11467ca92775c94ffcec85a240a284a77a901e5b767e33f37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9b3f989c4d7ee906ed0cf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间到了……？不，还没！\n更多，更多，更多更多更多！\n超越，我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5c1ee75b621bfad08c011e9dd5b4e715b0e6825006387bfab36ca64848517a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2693ea510053e4b5ef1df38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2277c2d72e403bcecdeb466b5f6de0ded1847035df490e8e8191d1ca7571eb11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dee6bc09279e3e9e8b3ec81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f93d3b7ef27d7cc0857d72ec2a4909bbb86efae229156b450540a7bebfc972c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f43c21bd9a090d8f9833d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
