      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:576c3c8f7cde8a57722b2db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777b4ad8979359adb6db6b7ac3d8844f696089febbf4880ad99e25d4bcfb7c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4d2512e5832c49f17f2fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轮到我了……尽全力表现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bca23ce8d39ed1ba31f1a9b1567ac6ed29173c82d8631afc12110a2b9b977db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba0c9df4a6b719810f336a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有点紧张……但没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27734bca390e107a891b5909f60fd63e33c74640d8bf9e8aecdf0addde632e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd8e6e457aa867dc47ba26a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员……我很仰赖你哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26dcffe70a2b8bca4e3a2ab8b3ccd8f4a6ee662969e0cf7e1381dfadbb9e775c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e73b816751f6798e259ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚来到学园的时候，\r\n连左右都分不清楚……\r\n真的一路都受到你的帮助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da209991a14fedbfc17c9db0caac2da2ed192673ea8d00efc8d067e1e7f67894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a68c347896025b77355b820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，没有任何奇怪的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a59517396ba8ccabbe6199774157ca648e6d3d4a54e9f1071b327ba2be9aef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bf6458015491c0a12ea82ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会不会有点太花哨了……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f190b3e9b965d69dd9ffe31d3369c63e8ba56879c9fdba932f9765af4aa0d48b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a103b64c4fe0dbc3303dfcaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，开始觉得紧张了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "049a3b7ddd1cd97ad92f7d40df467a31d68f083562dac681f84df7e42122ebb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5b3ae06493981953e7d08f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有穿好吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4388657d831f8d016f8ff9622807133403ef44aa7649f16ad827a4556573ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e2853aaea3a2a19c5a7e36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望能适合我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dc87ce3da9e4faa9ed4259d0ce85d9e1507ed722b8241fb2a7529551698aa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a32537973f4c8e7b97e5121",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这套衣服，就会觉得胸口好热……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1e8e949642d7316f46eced61508c1c7b820689e2e8931206611fe140c052f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af12ebdec200a6d9806c446f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会像圣诞树的星星一样……\r\n闪闪发光喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b2ecab6f722d2a72c054176d105341e2f251fb65921c128605ee67a908b480c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8332f4b5dc397c85d6b9969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很在意装饰的事吗？\r\n那就把粉丝送我的说明书给你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c151d63464e5c861fbfdc1e25db94e38c6c73eb00aad5619626080da1d36a04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb2374aa7a9b90cd8982b17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e26b0287de96cf1164592796aa236a0940c2bb95269faf9dc0e4dd8bb94a014",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dc1965ff05a532d0d30eccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上我的胜利给故乡的大家……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53519fdafb883a96741e64cab038c970532c0c1a6fdb2d84be8486aab0c6c3b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f61b6cf07c0886e1ecba6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，这打扮很令人心安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5dd77b5907a94df53b18588b1a024e1ab60648bbe62b366d43b12d6d577170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f04da34a503ca82a3b29f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起去吃饭吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0dcbeb9caac06c933cbc30231812be65ceebb66d00edf7ca107421c6324a1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a65a75fbf819e9fbe8935e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去迎接吧。用我的双脚，去迎接命运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7a619cdb2f1fce97d4bc8955eeb73269584bb96239037e5ac314fd52f496a8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff708fe2d6e45dd9aaf5b7e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发饰也是，星星也是。一直与我，同在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c612cd9b848c3dbf55c3e200b524bfcf1e2479cd520ade49d78a039baac82a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1006",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:279fb7b0413cbdcfa1761ff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，没有任何奇怪的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a59517396ba8ccabbe6199774157ca648e6d3d4a54e9f1071b327ba2be9aef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
